      "reason": "The review explicitly states its objectives/questions by defining the scope using the PICo framework (Population, Interest, Context), which is appropriate for this type of review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Study Design: A systematic review with narrative synthesis.",
      "reason": "This is a systematic review with narrative synthesis, not a review of intervention effects (e.g., meta-analysis of clinical interventions), so PICO comparisons are not required."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

